    <div class="pub-back guide-back" id="pub-help" hidden>
      <div class="pub guide">
        <div class="pub-head"><h2>GitHub Token</h2><button id="guide-x" class="pub-ico" type="button" title="Close"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m4.5 4.5 7 7m0-7-7 7"/></svg></button></div>
        <p class="guide-lead">Publishing opens a pull request on GitHub under your account. The token is what lets the editor do that. You make it once.</p>
        <ol class="guide-steps">
          <li><span>Open GitHub's token page. Sign in if it asks.</span>
